    {
      "id": "p1_ctxt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 592,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Rungs are anchored on the value zone's EDGE, not on the pivot: 1A = value high + width, 1B = value low − width.\nA compressed session throws close rungs (08-18: every 73.5 pts); an expansion day walks through many of them.\nTargets are pause points and profit-taking points — never places to fade the move.  Numbers: 2026-08-20 daily pivot, NQU6, job-study-daily.json",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:19:35.591Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:19:35.591Z",
      "version": 1
    }
  ],
